# Once triggered, Terror of the Peaks' ability is independent of it (CR 113.7a): exiled before the ability resolves, Terror
# still deals the damage, as it last existed (CR 608.2h). On turn 3 Bot1's Embereth Shieldbreaker enters and the ability is
# aimed at Bot2. In response Bot2 casts Swords to Plowshares at Terror, which costs {W} and 3 life (CR 601.2f): Terror is
# exiled and Bot1 gains 5 life, its power. The ability then deals 2 damage to Bot2: 20 - 3 - 2 = 15.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Show and Tell
Terror of the Peaks
Mountain
Embereth Shieldbreaker
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Swords to Plowshares x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Show and Tell.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Terror of the Peaks)
Bot2.Choose()
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Embereth Shieldbreaker.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Swords to Plowshares.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Terror of the Peaks)
Bot2.Choose(Pay mana)
? Bot2.Life = 17
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Exile = Terror of the Peaks
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Bot1.Life = 25
Bot2.Life = 15
Exile = Terror of the Peaks
Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Mountain; Embereth Shieldbreaker
